The tiny.en Whisper model is bundled as Transcriber's fallback. The other 11
retained Whisper model files are optional separate downloads:

- tiny, base.en, base, small.en, small, medium.en, medium,
  large-v3, large-v3-turbo, large-v3-turbo-q5_0 and large-v3-q5_0:
  OpenAI Whisper model weights, MIT, https://github.com/openai/whisper

Other optional model downloads are not bundled with Transcriber. Their
attribution and terms are:
- parakeet-tdt-ctc-110m: NVIDIA Parakeet TDT-CTC 110M, CC BY 4.0,
  https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt_ctc-110m
- moonshine-tiny: Useful Sensors Moonshine Tiny, MIT,
  https://huggingface.co/UsefulSensors/moonshine
- nemotron-3.5-0.6b: NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 ASR Streaming 0.6B,
  OpenMDW-1.1, https://huggingface.co/nvidia/nemotron-3.5-asr-streaming-0.6b
- qwen3-asr-0.6b: Alibaba Qwen3-ASR 0.6B, Apache-2.0,
  https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-0.6B
- canary-180m-flash: NVIDIA Canary 180M Flash, CC BY 4.0,
  https://huggingface.co/nvidia/canary-180m-flash
- medasr: Google Health AI MedASR, Health AI Developer Foundations terms,
  https://developers.google.com/health-ai-developer-foundations/terms
- moss-transcribe-diarize: OpenMOSS MOSS Transcribe-Diarize, Apache-2.0,
  https://huggingface.co/OpenMOSS-Team/MOSS-Transcribe-Diarize
